{"seq":2,"slug":"ci-pipeline-lint","title":"CI 流水线中的 Lint 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/team-ci-integration/ci-pipeline-lint","wordCount":831,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-流水线中的-lint-集成\">CI 流水线中的 Lint 集成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CI（持续集成）流水线中的 lint 检查是代码质量的<strong>最终防线</strong>。与本地 pre-commit 检查不同，CI lint 不可绕过、针对全量代码、且在代码合并前执行。设计合理的 CI lint 策略需要在<strong>检查全面性与执行效率</strong>之间取得平衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Push / PR 触发] --&gt; B[CI 流水线启动]&#10;    B --&gt; C[安装依赖]&#10;    C --&gt; D[并行检查]&#10;    D --&gt; E[格式化检查]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Lint 检查]&#10;    D --&gt; G[类型检查]&#10;    D --&gt; H[单元测试]&#10;    E --&gt; I{全部通过?}&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[允许合并]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K[阻止合并并报告]\">flowchart TD\n    A[Push / PR 触发] --&gt; B[CI 流水线启动]\n    B --&gt; C[安装依赖]\n    C --&gt; D[并行检查]\n    D --&gt; E[格式化检查]\n    D --&gt; F[Lint 检查]\n    D --&gt; G[类型检查]\n    D --&gt; H[单元测试]\n    E --&gt; I{全部通过?}\n    F --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt;|是| J[允许合并]\n    I --&gt;|否| K[阻止合并并报告]</pre><p>CI lint 与本地 lint 的分工对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>本地 lint-staged</th>\n<th>CI lint</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发时机</td>\n<td>git commit 前</td>\n<td>Push / PR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检查范围</td>\n<td>仅暂存文件</td>\n<td>全量代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可跳过</td>\n<td>--no-verify</td>\n<td>不可跳过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行环境</td>\n<td>开发者机器</td>\n<td>CI 服务器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反馈速度</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修复方式</td>\n<td>--fix 自动修复</td>\n<td>仅报告（--check）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"github-actions-实践\">GitHub Actions 实践</h2><p>GitHub Actions 是最常用的 CI 平台之一。以下是一个完整的 lint 工作流配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Code Quality&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main, develop]&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;concurrency:&#10;  group: ${{ github.workflow }}-${{ github.ref }}&#10;  cancel-in-progress: true&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  lint:&#10;    name: Lint &amp; Format&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          version: 9&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 22&#10;          cache: pnpm&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;&#10;      - name: Format Check&#10;        run: pnpm prettier --check &quot;src/**/*.{ts,tsx,css,json,md}&quot;&#10;&#10;      - name: Lint&#10;        run: pnpm eslint . --max-warnings 0&#10;&#10;      - name: Type Check&#10;        run: pnpm tsc --noEmit\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Code Quality</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">develop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">concurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ github.workflow }}-${{ github.ref }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  cancel-in-progress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  lint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Lint &#x26; Format</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">22</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Format Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm prettier --check \"src/**/*.{ts,tsx,css,json,md}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm eslint . --max-warnings 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Type Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm tsc --noEmit</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用 Biome 的简化版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"jobs:&#10;  quality:&#10;    name: Code Quality&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: biomejs/setup-biome@v2&#10;      - run: biome ci .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  quality</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Code Quality</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">biomejs/setup-biome@v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">biome ci .</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[PR 创建] --&gt; B[GitHub Actions 触发]&#10;    B --&gt; C{检查类型}&#10;    C --&gt; D[biome ci .]&#10;    C --&gt; E[tsc --noEmit]&#10;    C --&gt; F[vitest --run]&#10;    D --&gt; G[合并结果]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[PR 状态更新]\">flowchart LR\n    A[PR 创建] --&gt; B[GitHub Actions 触发]\n    B --&gt; C{检查类型}\n    C --&gt; D[biome ci .]\n    C --&gt; E[tsc --noEmit]\n    C --&gt; F[vitest --run]\n    D --&gt; G[合并结果]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[PR 状态更新]</pre><p><strong>关键实践</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实践</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>--frozen-lockfile</code></td>\n<td>确保依赖版本一致</td>\n<td>避免 CI 安装不同版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--max-warnings 0</code></td>\n<td>将 warning 视为 error</td>\n<td>CI 中不容忍任何警告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cancel-in-progress</code></td>\n<td>取消同分支旧任务</td>\n<td>节省 CI 资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--check</code> 而非 <code>--write</code></td>\n<td>CI 中只检查不修复</td>\n<td>明确责任归开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行 Job</td>\n<td>lint / test / typecheck 并行</td>\n<td>缩短总时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"缓存策略与性能优化\">缓存策略与性能优化</h2><p>CI 中的 lint 性能优化对于大型项目至关重要。主要优化方向包括依赖缓存、增量 lint 和任务并行化。</p>\n<p><strong>依赖缓存</strong>：缓存 <code>node_modules</code> 和包管理器缓存可以显著减少安装时间：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;  with:&#10;    node-version: 22&#10;    cache: pnpm\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">22</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>ESLint 缓存</strong>：ESLint 支持缓存功能，跳过未变更的文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Restore ESLint cache&#10;  uses: actions/cache@v4&#10;  with:&#10;    path: .eslintcache&#10;    key: eslint-${{ hashFiles(&#39;eslint.config.mjs&#39;) }}-${{ github.sha }}&#10;    restore-keys: |&#10;      eslint-${{ hashFiles(&#39;eslint.config.mjs&#39;) }}-&#10;&#10;- run: eslint --cache --cache-location .eslintcache .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Restore ESLint cache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/cache@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.eslintcache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">eslint-${{ hashFiles('eslint.config.mjs') }}-${{ github.sha }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    restore-keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      eslint-${{ hashFiles('eslint.config.mjs') }}-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">eslint --cache --cache-location .eslintcache .</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>增量 Lint</strong>：只对 PR 中变更的文件运行 lint：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Get changed files&#10;  id: changed&#10;  uses: tj-actions/changed-files@v44&#10;  with:&#10;    files: |&#10;      **/*.ts&#10;      **/*.tsx&#10;&#10;- name: Lint changed files&#10;  if: steps.changed.outputs.any_changed == &#39;true&#39;&#10;  run: eslint ${{ steps.changed.outputs.all_changed_files }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Get changed files</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">changed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tj-actions/changed-files@v44</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    files</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      **/*.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      **/*.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Lint changed files</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">steps.changed.outputs.any_changed == 'true'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">eslint ${{ steps.changed.outputs.all_changed_files }}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>时间节省</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>依赖缓存</td>\n<td>所有项目</td>\n<td>安装时间减少 60-80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ESLint 缓存</td>\n<td>大型项目</td>\n<td>lint 时间减少 50-70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量 lint</td>\n<td>PR 检查</td>\n<td>与变更文件数成正比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Biome 替代</td>\n<td>性能敏感项目</td>\n<td>lint 时间减少 90%+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行 Job</td>\n<td>多检查项目</td>\n<td>总时间取决于最慢 Job</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多平台-ci-配置\">多平台 CI 配置</h2><p>除 GitHub Actions 外，其他 CI 平台的 lint 配置模式类似：</p>\n<p><strong>GitLab CI</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"lint:&#10;  stage: quality&#10;  image: node:22&#10;  cache:&#10;    key: ${CI_COMMIT_REF_SLUG}&#10;    paths:&#10;      - node_modules/&#10;      - .eslintcache&#10;  script:&#10;    - npm ci&#10;    - npx eslint --cache .&#10;    - npx prettier --check .&#10;  rules:&#10;    - if: $CI_PIPELINE_SOURCE == &quot;merge_request_event&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">lint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">quality</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">node:22</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${CI_COMMIT_REF_SLUG}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">node_modules/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.eslintcache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx eslint --cache .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx prettier --check .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">$CI_PIPELINE_SOURCE == \"merge_request_event\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>通用 CI 脚本</strong>：编写平台无关的 lint 脚本，在 <code>package.json</code> 中统一管理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: &quot;eslint .&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lint:fix&quot;: &quot;eslint --fix .&quot;,&#10;    &quot;format&quot;: &quot;prettier --write .&quot;,&#10;    &quot;format:check&quot;: &quot;prettier --check .&quot;,&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot;: &quot;tsc --noEmit&quot;,&#10;    &quot;quality&quot;: &quot;npm run format:check &amp;&amp; npm run lint &amp;&amp; npm run typecheck&quot;,&#10;    &quot;quality:ci&quot;: &quot;biome ci .&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eslint .\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint:fix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eslint --fix .\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prettier --write .\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"format:check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prettier --check .\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsc --noEmit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"npm run format:check &#x26;&#x26; npm run lint &#x26;&#x26; npm run typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"quality:ci\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"biome ci .\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这样任何 CI 平台只需调用 <code>npm run quality</code> 或 <code>npm run quality:ci</code> 即可，不需要在 CI 配置中硬编码具体的工具命令。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[package.json scripts] --&gt; B[&quot;quality: format:check + lint + typecheck&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;quality:ci: biome ci&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[GitHub Actions]&#10;    B --&gt; E[GitLab CI]&#10;    B --&gt; F[Jenkins]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    C --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n    A[package.json scripts] --&gt; B[\"quality: format:check + lint + typecheck\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"quality:ci: biome ci\"]\n    B --&gt; D[GitHub Actions]\n    B --&gt; E[GitLab CI]\n    B --&gt; F[Jenkins]\n    C --&gt; D\n    C --&gt; E\n    C --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"失败报告与开发者体验\">失败报告与开发者体验</h2><p>CI lint 失败时的报告质量直接影响开发者的修复效率。</p>\n<p><strong>Problem Matchers</strong>：GitHub Actions 支持 Problem Matchers，可以将 lint 错误直接显示在 PR 的代码 diff 中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;problemMatcher&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;owner&quot;: &quot;eslint&quot;,&#10;      &quot;pattern&quot;: [&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;regexp&quot;: &quot;^(.+):(\\\\d+):(\\\\d+):\\\\s+(error|warning)\\\\s+(.+?)\\\\s+(.+)$&quot;,&#10;          &quot;file&quot;: 1,&#10;          &quot;line&quot;: 2,&#10;          &quot;column&quot;: 3,&#10;          &quot;severity&quot;: 4,&#10;          &quot;message&quot;: 5,&#10;          &quot;code&quot;: 6&#10;        }&#10;      ]&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"problemMatcher\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eslint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"pattern\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"regexp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^(.+):(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">d+):(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">d+):</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">s+(error|warning)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">s+(.+?)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">s+(.+)$\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"file\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"line\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"column\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Annotations</strong>：使用 GitHub Actions 的注解功能在代码行级别标记问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Lint with annotations&#10;  run: |&#10;    eslint . --format @microsoft/eslint-formatter-sarif --output-file eslint.sarif&#10;  continue-on-error: true&#10;&#10;- uses: github/codeql-action/upload-sarif@v3&#10;  with:&#10;    sarif_file: eslint.sarif\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Lint with annotations</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    eslint . --format @microsoft/eslint-formatter-sarif --output-file eslint.sarif</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  continue-on-error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">github/codeql-action/upload-sarif@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    sarif_file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">eslint.sarif</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>报告方式</th>\n<th>展示位置</th>\n<th>开发者体验</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯文本输出</td>\n<td>CI 日志</td>\n<td>需要手动查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Problem Matcher</td>\n<td>PR 文件 diff 行内</td>\n<td>直观定位问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SARIF 上传</td>\n<td>PR Security tab</td>\n<td>结构化问题列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Annotations</td>\n<td>PR Checks tab</td>\n<td>逐行标注</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((CI Lint))&#10;    流水线设计&#10;      格式化检查&#10;      Lint 检查&#10;      类型检查&#10;      并行执行&#10;    性能优化&#10;      依赖缓存&#10;      ESLint 缓存&#10;      增量 lint&#10;      Biome 替代&#10;    多平台&#10;      GitHub Actions&#10;      GitLab CI&#10;      平台无关脚本&#10;    失败报告&#10;      Problem Matchers&#10;      SARIF&#10;      行级注解&#10;    最佳实践&#10;      --check 不修复&#10;      --max-warnings 0&#10;      package.json 统一入口\">mindmap\n  root((CI Lint))\n    流水线设计\n      格式化检查\n      Lint 检查\n      类型检查\n      并行执行\n    性能优化\n      依赖缓存\n      ESLint 缓存\n      增量 lint\n      Biome 替代\n    多平台\n      GitHub Actions\n      GitLab CI\n      平台无关脚本\n    失败报告\n      Problem Matchers\n      SARIF\n      行级注解\n    最佳实践\n      --check 不修复\n      --max-warnings 0\n      package.json 统一入口</pre><ul>\n<li>CI lint 是代码质量的不可绕过的最终防线，与本地 pre-commit 形成两层保障</li>\n<li>性能优化的核心是缓存（依赖 + ESLint）和增量策略（只 lint 变更文件）</li>\n<li><code>package.json</code> scripts 作为平台无关的统一入口，避免在 CI 配置中硬编码工具命令</li>\n<li>Problem Matchers 和 SARIF 报告可以在 PR diff 中直观展示 lint 问题</li>\n<li>Biome 的 <code>ci</code> 命令是最简化的 CI lint 方案，单条命令覆盖格式化和 lint 检查</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CI 流水线中的 Lint 集成","id":"ci-流水线中的-lint-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GitHub Actions 实践","id":"github-actions-实践"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存策略与性能优化","id":"缓存策略与性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"多平台 CI 配置","id":"多平台-ci-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"失败报告与开发者体验","id":"失败报告与开发者体验"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"lint-staged 与 Husky 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/team-ci-integration/lint-staged-husky"},"next":{"title":"Monorepo 中的 Lint 策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/team-ci-integration/monorepo-lint-strategy"}}